new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/planning-availability.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
+Emergency Signage Translation at Safety Program on 2026-12-02: available.
+Oral History Release Audit at Archive Program on 2026-12-02: unavailable; its check was retried once.
